                      ? _NeonTheme.neonCyan
                      : (widget.isDarkMode
                            ? _NeonTheme.textSecondaryDark
                            : _NeonTheme.textSecondaryLight),
                ),
              ),
            ],
          ),
        ),
      ),
    );
  }

  Widget _buildCategoryChip(String category) {
    final isSelected = _selectedCategory == category;
    return Material(
      color: Colors.transparent,
      child: InkWell(
        onTap: _isSubmitting
            ? null
